1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
CropSight helps farmworkers turn unfamiliar crop symptoms into a clearer conversation.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Choose Seeds or Harvest, then add a crop photo. A close-up can provide another view.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Photos go to OpenAI only after consent. The API key stays on the server.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Live AI request · Waiting time shortened

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:25,000
This is a real model response. Numbered observations separate visible evidence from possible explanations.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:41,000
This test also exposes a limitation. The model calls the fruit healthy despite noticing a dark patch. That inconsistency needs human review. Its suggested next steps are not permission to harvest. We have not measured accuracy yet.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Copy a concise summary for your supervisor. The result states its limits and asks for human review.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
English comes first. Spanish and installation options live in Settings. AI analysis needs internet.
